id=xtbootguard
name=XT Boot Guard
version=v2.0
versionCode=2
author=XT-Line
description=Progressive bootloop guard (auto-installed with the kernel). 3 incomplete boots: disables all other modules. 6: writes a report and reboots to recovery. 9: restores the newest boot-image backup and reboots. Every boot is logged to /data/adb/xtbootguard/boot.log.
